id: EVT21-5
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: begin_skip_keep
target: crates/core/src/begin.rs
find:         .filter(|uid| instance::status_of(ir, &state.run, uid) == StepStatus::NotStarted)
replace:         .filter(|uid| instance::status_of(ir, &state.run, uid) != StepStatus::Achieved)
expect-fail: begin_at_the_same_start_again_does_not_duplicate
note: 省略済みの Step も対象にし、同じ開始点への再度の開始で再び省略する
